<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN LEU 5,360 TO DOLLAR FOR JAN 22 - BNR.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN LEU 5,360 TO DOLLAR FOR JAN 22 - BNR.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's National Bank (BNR) announced the leu's reference rate weaker at 5,360 to the dollar for January 22.</p>
<p>The reference rate set on Monday is a weighted average based on daily reports of foreign exchange operators. It is a guidance rate used for statistical accounting purposes.</p>
<p>The leu's reference rate set on Friday for January 21 is 5,181 to the dollar. It was 5,016 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
